# IG §10.9 — "the highest value-to-effort item on this list." Applies to
# every static asset response; Worker-generated responses would need their
# own headers, but this Worker has none (wrangler.jsonc has no `main`).
#
# connect-src carries two origins and no more:
#
#   'self'                  — the API Worker. It is routed at
#                             fleetsettle.com/api/* on the SAME host that
#                             serves this SPA, so it needs no entry of its
#                             own and no CORS anywhere. Worth not undoing.
#   https://api.asgardeo.io — the authorization-code exchange and token
#                             refresh (B8). Sign-in and sign-out are
#                             top-level navigations, which no directive
#                             here governs; this covers only the SDK's XHR
#                             to the token endpoint.
#
# No frame-src: the SDK's OIDC session-management iframe is off by default
# (`enableOIDCSessionManagement: false`) and we do not turn it on. Add one
# only alongside enabling it, never in advance.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.asgardeo.io; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
